      "text": "Module 15 — Observability & Production Operations",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Module 15 — Observability & Production Operations",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "itbkVN_xwtzELSz2LuKrg",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 691.936848958333,
      "y": 3699.65869140625,
      "width": 1285.4871826171875,
      "height": 200,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "as",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1905541677,
      "version": 1238,
      "versionNonce": 447561891,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790539092030,
      "created": 1790534881706,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Structured Logs - Record Specific Events\n2. Tracing - Record one task end to end\n3. Metrics - Aggregate Information (Track request/task rates, latency distributions, failures, queue age, active work, tokens, cost, escalations, and task outcomes)\n4. AI Telemetry — Capture More Than Server Health (Record model/provider/configuration, token usage, call count, retrieval source identifiers, \ntool names/arguments in controlled form, retries, agent steps, and outcome signals)\n5. Audit\n6. Convert the feedback to learning \n7. Alert and Runbook\n8. SLI/SLO and SLA\n",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Structured Logs - Record Specific Events\n2. Tracing - Record one task end to end\n3. Metrics - Aggregate Information (Track request/task rates, latency distributions, failures, queue age, active work, tokens, cost, escalations, and task outcomes)\n4. AI Telemetry — Capture More Than Server Health (Record model/provider/configuration, token usage, call count, retrieval source identifiers, \ntool names/arguments in controlled form, retries, agent steps, and outcome signals)\n5. Audit\n6. Convert the feedback to learning \n7. Alert and Runbook\n8. SLI/SLO and SLA\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
