      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "NA_haJ2b8k9g7235H2adI",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 693.395833333333,
      "y": 3309.991943359375,
      "width": 643.2953491210938,
      "height": 80,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "LpTkuwBLHWhpgY5EQnmaD"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "av",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 936985453,
      "version": 1222,
      "versionNonce": 174249325,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790539078244,
      "created": 1790535216656,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Can you release AI changes using evidence rather than a few attractive examples?\nCan you distinguish shadow evaluation from real user exposure?\nCan you identify which artifacts must be versioned together?\nCan you detect regressions and stop or reverse the change?",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Can you release AI changes using evidence rather than a few attractive examples?\nCan you distinguish shadow evaluation from real user exposure?\nCan you identify which artifacts must be versioned together?\nCan you detect regressions and stop or reverse the change?",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "vG4Xl6T-b37f8MsG2j2me",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 702.239583333333,
      "y": 3413.4512939453125,
      "width": 1078.5911865234375,
      "height": 180,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "LpTkuwBLHWhpgY5EQnmaD"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aw",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 320781539,
      "version": 1572,
      "versionNonce": 1671405517,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790539078244,
      "created": 1790535227608,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Dont only version the model rather version the behavior( prompts, artifacts, tools and schemas, corpurs/index versions. configurations)\n2. Offline Evaluation\n3. Release Gates - Pass/Fail/Hold(Human Review)\n4. Shadow Run\n5. Canary Deployment\n6. Rollback\n7. Killswitch\n8. Monitor and Feedback\n",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Dont only version the model rather version the behavior( prompts, artifacts, tools and schemas, corpurs/index versions. configurations)\n2. Offline Evaluation\n3. Release Gates - Pass/Fail/Hold(Human Review)\n4. Shadow Run\n5. Canary Deployment\n6. Rollback\n7. Killswitch\n8. Monitor and Feedback\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
