    {
      "id": "PMrEH0uNsztdtW_xla3__",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 712.679036458333,
      "y": 2728.6796875,
      "width": 1111.311279296875,
      "height": 160,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b08",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1086872259,
      "version": 721,
      "versionNonce": 428390883,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790539064719,
      "created": 1790537015262,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Attribution — Find What Changed : Track cost by task type, tenant, model, input/output usage, call count, tool use, retries, and outcomes.\n2. Model Routing\n3. Context Compression\n4. Cap on Retry for costly tool calls\n5. Output Control — Avoid Unnecessary Generation\n6. Caching\n7. Reduce Calls and Use Deterministic Logic\n8. Batch Processing — Trade Urgency for Efficiency ",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Attribution — Find What Changed : Track cost by task type, tenant, model, input/output usage, call count, tool use, retries, and outcomes.\n2. Model Routing\n3. Context Compression\n4. Cap on Retry for costly tool calls\n5. Output Control — Avoid Unnecessary Generation\n6. Caching\n7. Reduce Calls and Use Deterministic Logic\n8. Batch Processing — Trade Urgency for Efficiency ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
