      "text": "Review 10 — Latency and Performance",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Review 10 — Latency and Performance",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "ClH1wsojJRGqKO-DDXeTp",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 709.540364583333,
      "y": 2442.6661376953125,
      "width": 1167.98291015625,
      "height": 180,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0C",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1098318819,
      "version": 583,
      "versionNonce": 1076609091,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790539058090,
      "created": 1790537589416,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. P50/P95/P99 — Inspect the Distribution\n2. Trace the Request — Locate the Critical Path\n3. Time to First Token and Streaming — Improve Perceived Waiting\n4. Parallelization — Overlap Independent Work\n5. Reduce Sequential Model Hops — Remove Unnecessary Reasoning Calls\n6. Retrieval — Optimize the Evidence Path (Do Reranking)\n7. Queue Wait — Protect Tail Latency Under Load (Separate time waiting for capacity from actual processing. Apply admission control, tenant-aware \nlimits, bounded queues, and useful capacity scaling.)\n8. Async Delivery — Change the Interaction for Long Tasks",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. P50/P95/P99 — Inspect the Distribution\n2. Trace the Request — Locate the Critical Path\n3. Time to First Token and Streaming — Improve Perceived Waiting\n4. Parallelization — Overlap Independent Work\n5. Reduce Sequential Model Hops — Remove Unnecessary Reasoning Calls\n6. Retrieval — Optimize the Evidence Path (Do Reranking)\n7. Queue Wait — Protect Tail Latency Under Load (Separate time waiting for capacity from actual processing. Apply admission control, tenant-aware \nlimits, bounded queues, and useful capacity scaling.)\n8. Async Delivery — Change the Interaction for Long Tasks",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
