    {
      "id": "uEhHMrSM-WltsajnP8eVv",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 707.118489583333,
      "y": 2122.282958984375,
      "width": 725.5194091796875,
      "height": 200,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0G",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 984906979,
      "version": 973,
      "versionNonce": 1142254403,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790539052007,
      "created": 1790537879657,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Throughput and Concurrency — Translate Demand\n2. Before adding workers, I’d locate which dependency currently limits successful throughput\n3. Staless Worker + Durable State - Scale and Recover\n4. Database Recover\n5. Incremental Indexing in case of RAG\n6. Autoloader + Load Shedding\n7. Queue and Backpressure\n6. Admission Control\n7. Fair Scheduling\n8. Rate Limiting",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Throughput and Concurrency — Translate Demand\n2. Before adding workers, I’d locate which dependency currently limits successful throughput\n3. Staless Worker + Durable State - Scale and Recover\n4. Database Recover\n5. Incremental Indexing in case of RAG\n6. Autoloader + Load Shedding\n7. Queue and Backpressure\n6. Admission Control\n7. Fair Scheduling\n8. Rate Limiting",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
